  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>About our brand and products:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Endless Roses specializes in premium, preserved floral arrangements that maintain their natural beauty and freshness for up to a year or more. Our luxury roses are carefully curated to offer an elegant, long-lasting alternative to traditional bouquets, making them the perfect centerpiece for home decor or a sophisticated gift for any occasion.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>What makes us different:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>We focus on luxury and longevity. Unlike standard florists, our roses require no water or maintenance, providing lasting value to your audience. Our brand is synonymous with elegance, high-quality craftsmanship, and unforgettable gifting experiences.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>How affiliates can earn:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>Partners earn a competitive commission on every successful referral. With high average order values and products that are perfect for major gifting holidays like Valentine’s Day, Mother’s Day, and anniversaries, your earning potential is significant. We also offer performance-based bonuses for our top-tier creators.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>How to promote us:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>We encourage promotion through high-quality visual content. Share your unique affiliate link or custom discount code on Instagram, TikTok, Pinterest, or your lifestyle blog. Unboxing videos and home decor styling tips perform exceptionally well with our aesthetic.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><b>Other information:</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>We provide our affiliates with professional imagery and support to help you succeed. Please note that we maintain a premium brand image; therefore, we do not allow promotion on coupon-only sites or through unauthorized paid search ads.</p></div></div>",
